Third-party material: CQ's WAZ Zone Definitions page
----------------------------------------------------

The facts this package serves come from CQ's "WAZ Zone Definitions" page (https://cqww.com/cq_waz_list.htm, "Updated and correct as of
April 1, 2018"), copyright CQ Communications, Inc. and the World Wide Radio Operators Foundation,
Inc. (WWROF), all rights reserved.

The owner's document is NOT included in this package or its repository. It is referenced by URL,
and data/SOURCE.json records the date it was retrieved and its SHA-256, so anyone can fetch the
same document and check the facts against it (scripts/fetch_published.py does that for developers).

data/facts/cq_zones.json holds facts from that page (zone numbers, names, and the entities and
areas each zone covers, with CQ's short wording for partial areas), each citing the zone it comes
from. The definitions are the owner's; this project's GPL-3.0-or-later licence covers our own
code and files, not the owner's material, and we claim no rights in it.

Ours, labelled as ours: data/SOURCE.json, data/owner-list.schema.json, data/derived/ (built from the
facts) and data/load.sql (generated).

